# `collections.query_items`

Cursor-paginated item query — named-query ref or inline Kysely AST.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.collection.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `named_query` | `string` |
| `inline_ast` | `string` |
| `params_json` | `string` |
| `cursor` | `string` |
| `limit` | `number` |

## Returns

`ItemPage` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `items` | `map` |
| `next_cursor` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call collections.query_items --json '{ "named_query": "", "inline_ast": "", "params_json": "", "cursor": "", "limit": 0 }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "note-checkout-notes",
      "collection": "notes",
      "data_json": "eyJ0aXRsZSI6IkNoZWNrb3V0IG5vdGVzIiwiY29udGVudCI6IkF1dGggdmlhIEpXVC4ifQ==",
      "created_at": "2026-05-24T18:35:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-05-24T18:35:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "next_cursor": "dGVzdC1jdXJzb3I="
}
```
